# Saga PR self-merge policy

Agents working on Saga **self-merge** their PRs when **all** of the following
hold:

1. CI is green on the PR.
2. Full regression suite passes (API 35 Cases 1–10 + 4b + C3–C5 +
   onboarding/INBOUND_REJECT + RING regression; plus one API 29 run).
3. Release hygiene checks pass when they apply to the change.

**Merge method:** prefer **Rebase and merge**, or a merge commit. **Never
squash.** Delete the branch after merge.

**Do not self-merge** (stop and tell the user) if the PR changes any of:

- Cryptography or key handling
- Handshake / confirmation
- Trust / verification UI
- Release signing

If any gate is red, fix before merging. Never merge red.

After each multi-part sequence item is self-merged, **STOP and report** —
do not start the next part until the user says to continue.
